      "verified": false,
      "class_map": {
        "person": "person"
      },
      "notes": "官方页标注 [5K/1GB]；2026-11-20 本机实测 HTTP 200，815,585,330 字节（约 778MiB）。只作为 person 类补充样本，入库前需按巡检场景筛选。",
      "instructions": "从官方页 http://images.cocodataset.org/zips/val2017.zip 下载后 --register；https 入口证书异常，脚本不自动下载。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coco_2017_train_images",
      "dataset": "COCO 2017",
      "kind": "images",
